{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43111","headline":"秋闺 · 沈祖仙","name":"秋闺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白马三军客，青娥十载思。\n玉庭霜落夜，罗幌月明时。\n鑪冷蜘蛛喜，灯高熠燿期。\n愁多不可曙，流涕坐空帏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈祖仙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43111.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43111","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}